Package: certforge
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: ACME certificate manager with DANE and systemd integration
 Certforge automates ACME certificate issuance and renewal using DNS-01
 challenges via RFC 2136 dynamic DNS updates. It publishes DANE TLSA
 records, integrates with systemd credentials for secret storage, and
 supports post-renewal hooks to reload/restart services.
